<title>POLAND: Polish food prices fall 0.1 pct in May 10-20.</title>
<headline>Polish food prices fall 0.1 pct in May 10-20.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-05-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Polish food prices fell 0.1 percent in the May 10-20 period after rising 0.6 percent in the previous 10 days and were 0.8 percent higher than in the April 10-20 period, the Central Statistical Office (GUS) said.</p>
<p>				     MAY 10-20  MAY 1-10    LAST 30 DAYS</p>
<p>POLISH FOOD PRICES (AVG)     -0.1	   0.6	  0.8 (1.1)</p>
<p> Bread				0.1	   0.5	  0.6 (0.6)</p>
<p> Fruit and vegetables	  -2.3	   3.8	  3.5 (5.9)</p>
<p> Meat and meat-products	 0.2	   0.3	  0.6 (0.6)</p>
<p> Dairy products		   0.2	   0.5	  1.2 (1.3)</p>
<p> Eggs				-2.8	  -3.5	 -6.2 (-4.6)</p>
<p>NOTE: In brackets figures for the previous 30-day period ending on May 10.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
